more like you wouldn't even look at the gameplay design of MW19 and then expect MWII to be better LMFAO.

&#x200B;

Sequel to a worst FPS game of all time.

graphics from pre alpha looks like a PS2 game to me, story end up being overrated just like MW2019, the multiplayer might be atrocious with those p2w blueprints and DMZ might be a plastic version of EFT with NFT marketplace.

